<section class="tw-phil tw-section">
  <div class="tw-phil-inner">
    <p class="tw-eyebrow tw-eyebrow--center" data-reveal>How we think about healing</p>
    <p class="tw-phil-quote" data-reveal>
      We don’t believe healing has to be painful or exhausting. The fear of being
      overwhelmed is usually what keeps us away from the deeper feelings in the first
      place — most people have simply never had a safe, reliable way in.
    </p>
    <p class="tw-phil-quote" data-reveal>
      So we honour the wisdom the body already carries, and we go gently. Healing is
      yours alone to do; no method and no person can do it for you. What we can do is
      make it safe enough that what once felt unbearable can finally be heard — and
      finished.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
